{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/14/8244733/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/14/8244733/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々話したいことはあるけれど、\nそれは全てが終わってからにします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日は、ありがとう御座いました(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとずっとやりたかったライヴ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっとできたぁぁああヽ(；；)ノ泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に、本当に、感謝です(>_<)ぐゅっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方たちが携わってくれて、\nたくさんの方たちに支えられて、\n乃木坂46は今、井上小百合は今、\nこうしてステージに立つことができています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お父さん、お母さん、\n地元のお友達のみんな、\nメンバーのみんな、\nスタッフのみなさん、\nそして、応援してくださるみなさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうっ(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/14/8244733/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲中、振り付けでちょうど\n舞台袖が見えるとこがあって、\nそこでちょうど待機してるメンバーが\n手をふって「頑張れー！」って\nしてくれてるのが見えて、\nそれを見たら、色んな思いがぶわ（ ;  ; ）って\n溢れてきて涙で目がにじんで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、こぼしてはいけないって思って\n必死に堪えました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に、こんな素敵な仲間と一緒に\n頑張ることができてわたし、幸せです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂、大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、前日も眠れなくて、不安で、\n実はすごく緊張で爆発しそうだったんだけど、\nたくさんの人が応援してくれて\n本当に泣きそうな程嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ものすごく楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんって声も、\nしっかり聞こえたよ！ありがとう(=^^=)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/14/8244733/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この気持ちをどう表現したらいいか\nわからないんだけど、\nとにかく感謝です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとう(>_<)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/14/8244733/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もよろしくお願いします(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良し乃木坂"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/14/8244733/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/14/8244733/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"努力！感謝！笑顔！\nうちらは乃木坂 上り坂！４６！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/14/8244733/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/14/8244733/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/14/8244733/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/14/8244733/0010.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}